*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Replaces the 2025-07-16 Ragexe status-icon column      *
*                   with a resolution-aware top block beside the minimap.  *
*                   Native rendering and scale remain untouched. The       *
*                   /statusicons command is the sole custom-layout toggle, *
*                   independent of UI theme, /layout, and Game Settings.   *
*                   Custom mode fills from the minimap toward HP/SP and    *
*                   wraps only after resolution-derived width is used.     *
*                   Hover covers each full rendered 32x32 tile on the      *
*                   34x35 grid, leaving 2px X and 3px Y gutters. Toggle    *
*                   state saves immediately under savedata and restores    *
*                   across character-select and client restarts. Cash      *
*                   Shop, RO DEX, Gold PC, and Roulette keep their natural *
*                   creation routes. Roulette and Cash Shop share the top *
*                   row at the minimap's left and right edges. RO DEX sits *
*                   below Cash Shop, with Gold PC below RO DEX in the      *
*                   same right-aligned column. Launchers are never created *
*                   or force-shown.                                        *
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

